§§ `ss 21, 24 -- notification and advice`

#ASSERT `By when must the entity notify my disclosure and tell me` (`d` 15 1 2027) EQUALS `d` 12 2 2027
#ASSERT `By when must the entity notify my disclosure and tell me` (`d` 10 2 2028) EQUALS `d` 9 3 2028
-- Arguments: s 24 covers it, anonymous, notified, indicated wish, day of disclosure, advised, day advised, today.
-- Advised on the 28th day: in time; on the 29th: late.
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) TRUE (`d` 12 2 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `advised in time`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) TRUE (`d` 13 2 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `not advised in time`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) TRUE (`d` 20 1 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `advised in time`
-- Not yet advised: still running on the 28th day, late on the 29th.
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 12 2 2027) EQUALS `the time to advise me is still running`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 13 2 2027) EQUALS `not advised in time`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 16 1 2027) EQUALS `the time to advise me is still running`
-- No duty: made to the IBAC itself; anonymous (s 12A(2)); not notified and no wish for protections (s 24(5)).
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `the Act puts no duty to advise me on these facts`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `the Act puts no duty to advise me on these facts`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `the Act puts no duty to advise me on these facts`
-- Not notified, but the person asked for the protections: s 24(3) advice is owed.
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 15 1 2027) TRUE (`d` 1 2 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `advised in time`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 15 1 2027) FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `not advised in time`
-- Across February in a leap year: disclosed 10 February 2028, last day 9 March 2028.
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 10 2 2028) TRUE (`d` 9 3 2028) (`d` 1 4 2028) EQUALS `advised in time`
#ASSERT `Has the entity told me in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 10 2 2028) TRUE (`d` 10 3 2028) (`d` 1 4 2028) EQUALS `not advised in time`

