§§ `s 38A -- external disclosure`

-- Arguments: recipient is a Division 2 entity, original disclosure (named), determined and told, day told, same matter,
-- told of action, day told of action, asked for progress, day asked, got a response, day of response, response said
-- ongoing, completed, day completed, told completed, day told completed, day of external disclosure, may prejudice,
-- may reveal a method. Told of the determination on 1 March 2027: 6 months end 1 September 2027, 12 months 1 March 2028.
-- s 38A(3): no action told, asked 1 August 2027 (30 days end 31 August), no response; external on 2 September 2027.
#ASSERT `Can I make an external disclosure` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 1 8 2027) FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` (`d` 2 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- On the last day of the 6 months it is too early.
#ASSERT `Can I make an external disclosure` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 1 8 2027) FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A response on the 30th day (31 August) defeats (3)(b); one on the 31st day (1 September) does not.
#ASSERT `Can I make an external disclosure` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 1 8 2027) TRUE (`d` 31 8 2027) FALSE FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` (`d` 2 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I make an external disclosure` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 1 8 2027) TRUE (`d` 1 9 2027) FALSE FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` (`d` 2 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Told of action within 6 months (15 June 2027): (3) fails; (4) not yet (12 months not run).
#ASSERT `Can I make an external disclosure` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE TRUE (`d` 15 6 2027) TRUE (`d` 1 8 2027) FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` (`d` 2 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Told of action only after the 6 months (2 September 2027): (3)(a) still met.
#ASSERT `Can I make an external disclosure` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE TRUE (`d` 2 9 2027) TRUE (`d` 1 8 2027) FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` (`d` 3 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
